1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,233
Tickets, please.

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:08,133
The conductor walks down the aisle.
Navy coat. Brass buttons. A cap pulled
low. Her name badge is blank.

3
00:00:08,633 --> 00:00:12,767
The boy goes very still. He doesn't
say a word. He just stares at her
hands.

4
00:00:13,267 --> 00:00:21,200
Rule three. Keep your ticket in your
hand, not in your pocket. On this
train, no ticket means you get off at
the next stop.

5
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:26,400
She punches Nana's ticket. Admit
three. The hole she punches is shaped
like a nine.

6
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:32,467
Three. Good. Sit down. And when we
stop at a station with no name, don't
look out of the window.
